WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.820
The year's tax figures - slabs, rebates, caps and due dates - in one place. Everyone sees what every return uses; the portal owner fetches each year's, compares and applies.

2
00:00:14.438 --> 00:00:24.298
The figures every return on this portal uses today, and the year they are for. For everyone but the owner, this screen is read-only.

3
00:00:24.906 --> 00:00:36.806
The next year, or this year again: the department publishes circulars all year, so a re-check can move a due date. A reminder shows when a re-check is due.

4
00:00:37.406 --> 00:00:49.186
Pick Gemini or OpenAI and fetch: it searches official sources and proposes every figure in the same shape. It uses the owner's own AI key.

5
00:00:49.781 --> 00:00:57.561
How many figures there are, how many changed, how many are the same, and how many are not announced yet.

6
00:00:58.188 --> 00:01:06.248
Each figure side by side - the live year's and the new one's, what changed marked, and the source page for each.

7
00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:09.394
Show only what changed.

8
00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:17.835
A figure the AI got wrong or could not find: type the right one. It is marked as edited.

9
00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:27.523
Tick what is right, then apply. The figures go into the rules with History; last year's slabs stay for past years.

10
00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:35.030
A new rule that is not a figure - a new fee, a new form - is listed here, to be built.

11
00:01:35.656 --> 00:01:39.716
The pages the AI read, to check for yourself.

12
00:01:40.328 --> 00:01:45.248
Every rule SimplyFile works by, written out in one book.
